[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11463.11, "timestamp": "03:11:03", "text": "午後だから。えっと、それで私はそれを置いた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11465.67, "timestamp": "03:11:05", "text": "そこにいて、私は忘れてしまった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11469.83, "timestamp": "03:11:09", "text": "本当に忘れてたよ、あぁバカ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11472.469, "timestamp": "03:11:12", "text": "この大バカ野郎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11475.349, "timestamp": "03:11:15", "text": "どうして忘れられるの？どうしてそんなことができるの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11477.11, "timestamp": "03:11:17", "text": "忘れる？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11485.59, "timestamp": "03:11:25", "text": "これが名声だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11488.95, "timestamp": "03:11:28", "text": "それから、えっと、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11498.79, "timestamp": "03:11:38", "text": "6kです。えっと、音楽を一時停止させてください。あなた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11501.03, "timestamp": "03:11:41", "text": "私以外の声は何も聞かないで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11503.66, "timestamp": "03:11:43", "text": "右？これを締め切ります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11504.87, "timestamp": "03:11:44", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11510.79, "timestamp": "03:11:50", "text": "えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11512.79, "timestamp": "03:11:52", "text": "待って。ちょっと画面を非表示にします"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11516.74, "timestamp": "03:11:56", "text": "それでは、これをお見せしましょう。"}]